#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Algorithms: IAU 2006 precession and nutation, JPL DE440 (SPK) or Standish/ELP2000 analytic ephemerides, SGP4 (Vallado 2006),\nKrisciunas & Schaefer sky brightness, Schaefer visual thresholds, triangle-invariant star matching with RANSAC, TAN-SIP WCS,\nstacking with kappa-sigma, winsorized, linear-fit and generalized-ESD rejection, drizzle (Fruchter & Hook),\nRichardson-Lucy with total variation (Dey et al.), starlet wavelets (Starck & Murtagh), generalized hyperbolic stretch,\nmulti-point lucky imaging, spherical planetary derotation, generalised Lomb-Scargle, BLS, PDM, Kwee-van Woerden, Mandel-Agol-type transit model with ensemble MCMC."
msgstr "Algoritmi: precessione e nutazione IAU 2006, JPL DE440 (SPK) o effemeridi analitiche Standish/ELP2000, SGP4 (Vallado 2006),\nluminosità del cielo di Krisciunas & Schaefer, soglie visuali di Schaefer, abbinamento stellare invariante per triangoli con RANSAC, WCS TAN-SIP,\nstacking con rigetto kappa-sigma, winsorizzato, a fit lineare ed ESD generalizzato, drizzle (Fruchter & Hook),\nRichardson-Lucy con variazione totale (Dey et al.), wavelet starlet (Starck & Murtagh), stretch iperbolico generalizzato,\nlucky imaging multipunto, derotazione planetaria sferica, Lomb-Scargle generalizzato, BLS, PDM, Kwee-van Woerden, modello di transito tipo Mandel-Agol con MCMC d'insieme."

